---
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import WorldMap from '../components/visuals/WorldMap.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import BreachCostBars from '../components/charts/BreachCostBars.astro';
import BlockersDiagram from '../components/visuals/BlockersDiagram.astro';
---

<Section id="problem" tone="surface" labelledBy="problem-title">
  <h2 id="problem-title">Privacy law is regional. AI models are global.</h2>

  <div class="stat-block">
    <div class="stat-map" aria-hidden="true"><WorldMap /></div>
    <div class="stat-copy">
      <p class="stat stat-xl">29%</p>
      <p class="stat-text">of countries have no data-privacy law in force.</p>
      <p class="source">Source: UNCTAD, <em>Data Protection and Privacy Legislation Worldwide</em> (June 2024).</p>
      <p class="stat-explain">
        People there have no legal protection when their personal data is collected and used to train AI. A free,
        portable framework gives them a baseline to build on.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="affected">
    <div>
      <h3>Who's affected</h3>
      <ul class="rows affected-rows">
        <li>
          <strong>Patients and students</strong>
          <p>Their own records train the models that judge them.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Under-resourced organizations</strong>
          <p>Startups, labs and NGOs with no privacy team.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Unprotected populations</strong>
          <p>No law means no floor to stand on.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <Photo
      name="photo-a"
      alt="A community health worker talking with a patient at a clinic."
      description="A health worker or clinic scene in a low- or middle-income country, in natural light, people shown with dignity."
      credit="Photo via Unsplash"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="cost">
    <h3>The real cost</h3>
    <div class="cost-grid">
      <div class="cost-chart">
        <BreachCostBars />
      </div>
      <div class="cost-facts">
        <ul class="rows">
          <li>
            <strong>Silent, permanent leaks.</strong>
            <p>AI models can memorize and later reveal the data they were trained on.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Eroded participation.</strong>
            <p>When people distrust a system, they hold back data from health and civic services.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="callout">
          <p class="stat stat-lg">2.75 years</p>
          <p>
            How long Blue Shield of California's leak of member health data went unnoticed. No hacking was involved.
          </p>
          <p class="source">Source: Healthcare Dive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="blockers">
    <div class="blockers-copy">
      <h3>Three blockers keep the gap open.</h3>
      <ol class="rows blockers-list">
        <li>
          <span class="mono num">01</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Legal</strong>
            <p>Protection stops at borders. Models and data do not.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mono num">02</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Economic</strong>
            <p>More data can mean better accuracy, so privacy gets treated as a cost.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="mono num">03</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Social</strong>
            <p>Consent fatigue makes clicking "agree" an unreliable safeguard.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <BlockersDiagram />
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  h2 {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .stat-block {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: var(--s-6);
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 320px;
  }
  .stat-map {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .stat-map :global(svg) {
    width: min(100%, 720px);
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .stat-copy {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-2);
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .stat-xl {
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7.5rem);
  }
  .stat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 1.9rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stat-explain {
    margin-top: var(--s-1);
  }
  .affected,
  .cost,
  .blockers {
    margin-top: var(--s-12);
  }
  .affected {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .affected h3,
  .cost h3,
  .blockers h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-3);
  }
  .rows strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .cost-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-5);
  }
  .callout {
    margin-top: var(--s-4);
    padding-top: var(--s-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-1);
  }
  .stat-lg {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .blockers {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .blockers-list {
    list-style: none;
  }
  .blockers-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-2);
  }
  .blockers-list .num {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption);
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .affected {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
      gap: var(--s-8);
    }
    .cost-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
      gap: var(--s-8);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .blockers {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
      gap: var(--s-8);
    }
    .stat-block {
      min-height: 400px;
    }
  }
</style>
